  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 902.25 “Replace in-kind” as applied to a stream crossing means the removal of all or a portion of an existing legal structure and the installation of a new structure o",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 902.25 “Replace in-kind” as applied to a stream crossing means the removal of all or a portion of an existing legal structure and the installation of a new structure or new portion of the structure that is the same or functionally equivalent to the original structure in all material aspects, including size, dimensions, location, and configuration.\n\nSource. #12809, eff 12-15-19",
